---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="py-12 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">© {currentYear} Miguel Dias</p>
      <a href="mailto:miguel@migueldias.eu" class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">
        miguel@migueldias.eu
      </a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">About</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        This blog is about delivering more value to the customer, with Lean Management, Value Stream Mapping and DevOps.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>